text:
Welcome to {{tenant.name}}, {{userName}}
=====================================
Your account has been created.
  Full name:    {{userName}}
  Login email:  {{email}}
Activate your account: {{activationLink}}

If this account was not created by you, please contact your administrator.

{{tenant.footer}}
{{tenant.disclaimer}}
Language: {{i18n.en}} | {{i18n.fr}} | {{i18n.es}}

{{tenant.name}} Password Reset Request
=====================================
Hi {{userName}},
Reset your password here (expires {{expiresIn}}): {{resetLink}}

SECURITY NOTICE: If you did not request this, ignore this email. Your password will not change unless you click the link. Never share it.

{{tenant.footer}}
{{tenant.disclaimer}}

Security Alert: Your {{tenant.name}} Account Was Locked
Account: {{email}}
Locked at: {{lockedAt}}
Failed attempts: {{failedAttempts}}
Unlock: {{unlockLink}}

If you did not attempt these sign-ins, contact your administrator immediately.

{{tenant.footer}}
{{tenant.disclaimer}}

{{tenant.name}} — Supplier Registration Approved
Dear {{companyName}},
Your registration has been approved.
  Supplier ID: {{supplierId}}
  Approved on: {{approvedAt}}
Access the portal: {{portalUrl}}

Buyer contact: {{buyerName}} <{{buyerEmail}}>

{{tenant.footer}}
{{tenant.disclaimer}}

{{tenant.name}} — Supplier Registration Update
Dear {{companyName}},
Your registration could not be approved.
  Supplier ID: {{supplierId}}
  Reason: {{rejectionReason}}
Review and reapply: {{portalUrl}}

{{tenant.footer}}
{{tenant.disclaimer}}

{{tenant.name}} — Supplier Requalification Required
Dear {{companyName}},
Requalification is due by {{dueDate}}.
  Supplier ID: {{supplierId}}
  Required items: {{requiredItems}}
Start now: {{portalUrl}}

If not completed by the due date, your profile may be placed on hold.

{{tenant.footer}}
{{tenant.disclaimer}}

{{tenant.name}} — Supplier Disqualification Notice
Dear {{companyName}},
Your supplier profile has been disqualified effective {{effectiveDate}}.
  Reason: {{reason}}
  Reinstatement: {{reinstatementPath}}

Outstanding purchase orders remain governed by their terms.

{{tenant.footer}}
{{tenant.disclaimer}}

{{tenant.name}} — Supplier Performance Review Available
Dear {{companyName}},
Your {{period}} performance scorecard is available.
  Overall score: {{overallScore}}
  On-time delivery: {{otdPercent}}
  Quality rating: {{qualityRating}}
View: {{portalUrl}}

{{tenant.footer}}
{{tenant.disclaimer}}

{{tenant.name}} — RFQ Invitation: {{eventTitle}}
Dear {{companyName}},
You are invited to respond to a sourcing event.
  Event: {{eventTitle}} ({{eventId}})
  Type: {{eventType}}
  Due: {{dueDate}}
Respond here: {{respondUrl}}
Questions due by {{questionDeadline}}.

{{tenant.footer}}
{{tenant.disclaimer}}

{{tenant.name}} — Award Notification: {{eventTitle}}
Dear {{companyName}},
Award decision for {{eventTitle}} ({{eventId}}): {{awardStatus}}.
  Awarded value: {{awardValue}}
Details: {{awardUrl}}

{{tenant.footer}}
{{tenant.disclaimer}}

{{tenant.name}} — PR {{prNumber}} Requires Your Approval
Hi {{approverName}},
PR {{prNumber}} from {{requesterName}} requires your approval.
  Amount: {{prAmount}} {{currency}}
  Category: {{category}}
  Due by: {{dueDate}}
Approve: {{approveUrl}}
Review/Reject: {{reviewUrl}}
Workflow '{{workflowName}}' — escalation after {{approvalSlaHours}}h.

{{tenant.footer}}
{{tenant.disclaimer}}

{{tenant.name}} — PR {{prNumber}} Rejected
Hi {{requesterName}},
PR {{prNumber}} was rejected by {{approverName}}.
  Reason: {{rejectionReason}}
Revise and resubmit: {{resubmitUrl}}

{{tenant.footer}}
{{tenant.disclaimer}}

{{tenant.name}} — Purchase Order {{poNumber}} Dispatch
Dear {{companyName}},
PO {{poNumber}} dated {{poDate}} has been issued.
  Total: {{poTotal}} {{currency}}
  Delivery: {{deliveryDate}}
  Ship to: {{shipToAddress}}
Acknowledge by {{ackDeadline}}: {{acknowledgeUrl}}

{{tenant.footer}}
{{tenant.disclaimer}}

{{tenant.name}} — PO {{poNumber}} Change Notice
Dear {{companyName}},
Change {{changeNumber}} ({{changeType}}) issued to PO {{poNumber}}.
  New total: {{newTotal}} {{currency}}
Review: {{reviewUrl}}
Acknowledge by {{ackDeadline}}.

{{tenant.footer}}
{{tenant.disclaimer}}

{{tenant.name}} Order Confirmation — {{poNumber}}
Thank you, {{userName}}. Your order {{poNumber}} is confirmed.
  Total: {{orderTotal}} {{currency}}
  Date: {{orderDate}}
Track: {{trackingUrl}}

{{tenant.footer}}
{{tenant.disclaimer}}

{{tenant.name}} — Receipt Confirmation {{receiptNumber}}
Hi {{userName}},
Receipt {{receiptNumber}} vs PO {{poNumber}} posted on {{receiptDate}}.
  Quantity: {{receivedQty}} / {{orderedQty}}
View: {{receiptUrl}}

{{tenant.footer}}
{{tenant.disclaimer}}

{{tenant.name}} — Receipt Discrepancy {{receiptNumber}}
Hi {{userName}},
Discrepancy ({{discrepancyType}}) on receipt {{receiptNumber}} vs PO {{poNumber}}.
  Details: {{discrepancyDetails}}
Resolve: {{resolveUrl}}

{{tenant.footer}}
{{tenant.disclaimer}}

{{tenant.name}} — Invoice {{invoiceNumber}} Requires Attention
Hi {{userName}},
Invoice {{invoiceNumber}} ({{supplierName}}) is on exception.
  Amount: {{invoiceAmount}} {{currency}}
  Exception: {{exceptionType}} — {{exceptionDetails}}
  Match: {{matchStatus}}
Review: {{reviewUrl}}

The invoice is blocked until resolved.

{{tenant.footer}}
{{tenant.disclaimer}}

{{tenant.name}} — Invoice {{invoiceNumber}} Approved
Hi {{userName}},
Invoice {{invoiceNumber}} approved for {{approvedAmount}} {{currency}}.
  Approved by: {{approvedBy}}
Scheduled for payment per agreed terms.

{{tenant.footer}}
{{tenant.disclaimer}}

{{tenant.name}} — Payment Completed for Invoice {{invoiceNumber}}
Dear {{companyName}},
Payment completed.
  Amount: {{paymentAmount}} {{currency}}
  Date: {{paymentDate}}
  Method: {{paymentMethod}}
  Reference: {{paymentReference}}
Remittance: {{remittanceUrl}}

{{tenant.footer}}
{{tenant.disclaimer}}

{{tenant.name}} — Payment Failed for Invoice {{invoiceNumber}}
Hi {{userName}},
Payment to {{supplierName}} failed.
  Amount: {{paymentAmount}} {{currency}}
  Reason: {{failureReason}}
  Retry: {{retryDate}}
Review: {{reviewUrl}}

No funds left the account.

{{tenant.footer}}
{{tenant.disclaimer}}

{{tenant.name}} — Action Required: {{workflowTask}}
Hi {{userName}},
Task '{{workflowTask}}' assigned on {{entityType}} {{entityNumber}}.
  Assigned by: {{assignedBy}}
  Due by: {{dueDate}}
Open: {{taskUrl}}
Escalation after {{escalationHours}}h.

{{tenant.footer}}
{{tenant.disclaimer}}

{{tenant.name}} — Workflow Escalation: {{workflowTask}}
Hi {{userName}},
Task '{{workflowTask}}' on {{entityType}} {{entityNumber}} escalated to you.
  Original owner: {{originalOwner}}
  Reason: {{escalationReason}}
  Due: {{dueDate}}
Take action: {{taskUrl}}

{{tenant.footer}}
{{tenant.disclaimer}}

{{tenant.name}} — Scheduled Maintenance Notification
Hi {{userName}},
Maintenance window: {{startTime}} to {{endTime}} ({{timeZone}}).
  Impact: {{impact}}
  Status page: {{statusUrl}}

{{tenant.footer}}
{{tenant.disclaimer}}
